		{"id":"1c83a13335051487","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260521140852.png","x":9459,"y":2013,"width":850,"height":267},
		{
			"id":"1769cb4bbba0d573",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[求特征向量的两大技巧](https://v.douyin.com/YEAi3v7F424/)：\n\n1. 同一个特征值下的两个特征向量 - 规避施密特正交化\n2. 快速行变换：求某个特征值对应的特征向量，由于满足特征多项式 $=0$，所以列不秩，因此可以直接**保留两行不成比例的，第三行直接抹成 $0$**。\n3. 已知同一个特征值下的两个特征向量，如何求第三个不同特征值下的特征向量，**矩阵的第一行直接作为特征向量** —— 有效方程行作为第三个特征向量（没咋了 5.5 小节）",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":8289,
			"y":3614,
			"width":491,
			"height":306
		},
		{"id":"03ef6746f70db9ad","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260521131900.png","x":7640,"y":1657,"width":860,"height":356},
		{"id":"81a245b81aea4151","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260523150049.png","x":10309,"y":1774,"width":599,"height":506},
		{"id":"e0722282e0301337","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260525023028.png","x":10422,"y":4040,"width":693,"height":284},
		{"id":"06e7b376206ec3b9","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/result_57bad6.png","x":10422,"y":4324,"width":698,"height":1252},
		{
			"id":"d4c5a1db00690a13",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"所有 $\\xi_i$ 都是用来拼正交矩阵 $Q$ 对应的**单位正交特征向量**",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":11180,
			"y":4152,
			"width":540,
			"height":60
		},
