		{
			"id":"8890eaa5050bc051",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"⭐实对称矩阵相似对角化**技巧**：\n\n1. 有效方程行作为第三个特征向量\n2. 规避施密特",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":15840,
			"y":12380,
			"width":380,
			"height":300
		},
		{"id":"5f41d889f9c7cf90","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260521143215.png","x":15740,"y":11136,"width":650,"height":566},
		{
			"id":"81d48cdac3251d0f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"相似的传递性 \n19年数一T21",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":15780,
			"y":9580,
			"width":280,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"3d429fdbae5791a7",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"反求矩阵问题",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":15840,
			"y":8146,
			"width":280,
			"height":120
		},
		{
			"id":"dd1685e6bdcf7984",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"求解矩阵的高次幂：\n\n由相似理论，得到：\n\n$$\nA = P \\Lambda P^{-1}\n$$ \n它的高次幂，中间可以约掉很多 $P P^{-1}$\n\n2024数一 T21\n2016数一 T21",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":15760,
			"y":8680,
			"width":460,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"793bff5fddb77122",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"转置之后相似手段 P 改变了，同样变成转置",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":15920,
			"y":5674,
			"width":440,
			"height":95
		}
	],
